lim_{x->0} sin(x)/x = 1 ; lim (1 - cos x)/x^2 = 1/2 ; lim (e^x - 1)/x = 1
one-sided limits of |x|/x at 0: from the right 1 , from the left -1
sin(1/x) at 0: ind (Sage reports an indeterminate value: the function oscillates between -1 and 1)
limits at infinity: lim x e^{-x} = 0 ; lim (log x)/x = 0 ; lim x^2/e^x = 0
